   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "That wasn't its maximum output, was it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Nope. Does it pass?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "I'd say so. How's the Transition Route coming?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "All readyyy.@Also, two Uyudaro-class ships are being@dispatched to the Rugonsaze sector.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "...I hadn't heard about that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "I think it's in case something@comes out of the Cross Gate.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "Hmm... If that happens, it happens.@<Golaikunru> ends up profiting either way.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "Oh my, could it be that you mean...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "That'd make a nice trap, right? For either side.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "Ufufu, I don't quite get what you meaaan.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "Eh, whatever. Send Kinaha to Rabulpaila@to keep an eye on things.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Roger that~",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Cross Gate Space",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Rabulpaila Control Room",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Reggiane",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Now, the Earth forces won't dare come near@us carelessly. Hurry up with the@space transfer preparations.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "Operator",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "Ah, wait! The Hagane has been spotted!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "What!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "It's right next to Rabulpaila!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Tch, don't tell me...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "Herluga",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Sortie, Reggiane.@Buy us time until the space transfer begins.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Leave it to me, Lord Herluga.@...Let's go, Bilgo.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Bilgo",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "You'll let me accompany you...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "Yeah. You keep botching missions involving@the Steel Dragons, so I'm giving you a chance.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Yes, ma'am. Thank you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Clear your name in front of me.@If you can't, a scolding won't be the end of it.@I hate useless men.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "...I will surely live up to@your expectations, Lady Reggiane.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "...Saving the space transfer was the right call,@but to come out in a place like this...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "It was a plan to both dodge the Zemon Mortar@and carry out the mission.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "I did say I'd leave it to you... Well, fine.@Now that we've come this far,@we have to see it through.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "Understood.@XO, the enemy has spotted us.@Deploy the mobile units.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "Tetsuya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Roger. Deploying mobile units!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "So the Hagane dodged with a space transfer.@Then I'll settle this with my own hands.@That's more my style anyway.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Reggiane,@we won't let you have the Cross Gate!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "Hmph, did they promise you safety in return@for guiding them to Rabulpaila?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "If so, would we bother coming here?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "We want to end the war between@Gadisword and Earth quickly!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "Big talk from people barging in@with mobile weapons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "Fairy",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "If Rabulpaila doesn't disarm and you don't@come to the negotiating table, the Earth Federation@Army will launch an all-out attack.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "And you're its vanguard.@Which means you've no intention of negotiating.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "(If you don't pull back, the Earth Federation Army@means to wipe you out, civilians and all!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Vort!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "Oh, still alive, are you? You've got the devil's luck.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "Why... did you fire without warning...?@My subordinates were in that area...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "...It couldn't be helped.@I too am desperate to protect our people.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "If they fell as Rabulpaila's shield,@surely they died as they would have wished.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "What...?! You used us as decoys?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "To gain further cooperation from Golaikunru,@we had to demonstrate the Zemon Mortar's power.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "B-Be that as it may...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "After that blow, the enemy will hesitate to advance.@Buy just a little more time and victory is ours.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Your subordinates became@a noble sacrifice toward that end.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "You...!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "I told you, Vort Nikolaus.@We cannot be choosy about how@we restore Gadisword.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "...Fairy, Steel Dragons, can you hear me?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "In about an hour...@Rabulpaila's space transfer will be ready...@In other words, you have...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "He's been shot?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Tch, meddling fool...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "Vort!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Captain!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "H-He's going down!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Even Anex's ace came to a pathetic end.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Bilgo! You bastard!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Commander, a message from the Cross Gate Watch@Fleet to our rear. They're launching the 13th Special@Ops PT Unit to destroy Rabulpaila's transfer device.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "So they came up to space too...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "They're requesting that we draw off the enemy's@main force until the unit can infiltrate@Rabulpaila.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Tell them we understand.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Yes, ma'am!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Attention, all units. Herluga's aim is to use@a space transfer to carry the Cross Gate@away from the Earth Sphere.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Their departure would end the fighting,@which could be called a desirable result...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "but we absolutely cannot allow aliens@to misuse the Cross Gate.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "I believe you can see this through.@Within the hour, capture or defeat@Herluga Izberga!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Now that's a rare sight,@the Commander giving us a pep talk like that.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "Maybe deep down he's secretly the hot-blooded type?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "Now then... I'll make a bloody example of anyone@who comes close. With my Gyanonia Braga.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "It appears its close-combat capability@has been improved even beyond Vort's@machine, dearie.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "And it's red, too. Now that's interesting!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Heh, don't get cocky, little girl.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "It's usually old ladies who talk like that!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "Then I'll teach you how scary a grown woman can be.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "Earthlings, and you traitors...@On the honor of the Royal Guard,@I'll wipe you out!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "But at this range, they can't use@the Zemon Mortar on us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "We'll tear through them and drag Herluga out.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "Eleve 1 to all units! Commence attack!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Eita",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Gravity quake reading above the ship, Range 4!@ES Wave Pattern: Zovorg!@Transfer emergence imminent!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Golaikunru reinforcements!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Heh, that Gomoudokka sure is dutiful.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "Zovorg units descending fast! Straight down@from directly above! Entering Range 3!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "If you're here, does that mean Gomoudokka@has finally acknowledged the Zemon Mortar's@power and reliability?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Kinaha",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "It does.@Let's remove these pests as soon as possible,@so you can deliver the Cross Gate and Rabulpaila.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "You didn't bring your troops@just to watch, did you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "Of course not.@I, too, have a deep history with someone@in the Steel Dragons... Hm?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "Oh? That machine is...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "G-Granzon! You're still here?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "He never learns, does he?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "(Th-There's no need to push myself to beat that man.@Yes, as long as I buy time...!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "Of course. I, too, have a deep history@with someone in the Steel Dragons.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "Kinaha Sokonko! Adding to your crimes@will do you no good!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "A bit late for that... Next time it'll be@the death penalty for sure.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "(Besides, this time I needn't defeat them.@I only have to buy time until@Rabulpaila transfers.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "All units, commence attack!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "Ngh! Gah!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "Eject! We won't take your life!@We've got questions for you!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "Ugh... H-How naive...@As if I'd... believe words like that...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "It's true! Ditch your machine, quick!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Th-The only one I trust... is Lady Reggiane...@Ah... P-Please forgive me...@for this, Bilgo's... greatest failure...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Eject! We won't take your life!@We have questions for you!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "You can't fight anymore!@You're coming with us as a prisoner!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "Ugh... N-No... As if I'd...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "And you're gonna spill everything you know!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 382,
   "en": "L-Lady Reggiane... please forgive me...@for this, Bilgo's... greatest failure...@I-I'll take responsibility... right now...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 383,
   "en": "...?! He's going to self-destruct?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 384,
   "en": "You can't fight anymore!@You're coming with us as a prisoner!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 385,
   "en": "Ugh... N-No... As if I'd...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 386,
   "en": "And you're going to tell us@everything you know!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 387,
   "en": "Don't tell me he's going to self-destruct?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 388,
   "en": "L-Lady Reggiane... please forgive me...@f-for this, Bilgo's... greatest failure...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 389,
   "en": "A-And... please...@give me your... very finest scolding...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 390,
   "en": "...Ending up like this, here of all places...@utterly useless. Someone who's no help when it@counts is trash... no, lower than trash.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 391,
   "en": "Ah, aah... ah...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 392,
   "en": "Hurry up... Hurry up and croak already!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 393,
   "en": "Aah... Reggia... ne...............",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 394,
   "en": "(Stupid man...@I wanted to praise you, at least at the end...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 395,
   "en": "(To think you'd die looking so happy...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 396,
   "en": "But I won't let your death be in vain!@That Zemon will be ours, no matter what!@For the restoration of Gadisword!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 397,
   "en": "...Reggia... ne.........!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 398,
   "en": "Abandon your machine and eject!@You're under arrest!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 399,
   "en": "I-I survived last time too!@M-My luck hasn't run out yet! This time, too...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 400,
   "en": "...?! Th-The ejection system?!@N-No way...!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 401,
   "en": "(She couldn't eject...?!)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 402,
   "en": "Well... I've sent you to your end,@Kinaha Sokonko.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 403,
   "en": "A-At the very last moment, it's that man!!@H-How unlucky can I beeeeee!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 404,
   "en": "Everything is the sum of your own choices.@It was your way of life, blaming fate for everything,@that decided how you would end up.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 405,
   "en": "I-I fought Shu Shirakawa and survived!@And I end here of all placeees!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 406,
   "en": "Tch! Not bad!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 407,
   "en": "Reggiane, return for now.@I'll send out the Floraga to buy@a little more time.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 408,
   "en": "You're sortieing yourself, Lord Herluga?!@And it hasn't had its final adjustments yet...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 409,
   "en": "I can't let the Steel Dragons destroy@the transfer device now.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 410,
   "en": "I'll draw them in with the Floraga and buy time.@You stay by my side and cover me.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 411,
   "en": "Bilgo, Lord Herluga is going out in the Floraga.@I'm going to be his escort, so I'm leaving@this to you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 412,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 413,
   "en": "Just buy time until the transfer.@Don't do anything reckless and get yourself killed.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 414,
   "en": "(Lady Reggiane...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 415,
   "en": "Kinaha, Lord Herluga is sortieing.@I'm going to be his escort, so I'm leaving@this to you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 416,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 417,
   "en": "(This... I'd better wrap things up@at a suitable point.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 418,
   "en": "Reggiane ran away?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 419,
   "en": "To leave no worries behind us,@destroy all enemy units outside Rabulpaila!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 420,
   "en": "All enemy signatures outside Rabulpaila gone!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 421,
   "en": "XO, we'll split the mobile units in two.@One group will storm Rabulpaila and search for@Herluga. The other will escort the ship.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 422,
   "en": "Yes, sir, right away...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 423,
   "en": "High energy reading from Rabulpaila's@central underside!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 424,
   "en": "Is it absorbing energy@from the Cross Gate?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 425,
   "en": "No, this is... Ah, multiple heat sources closing!@From Rabulpaila's underside, depression 40!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 426,
   "en": "Energy field, deploy on the lower hemisphere!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 427,
   "en": "Was there a Missile Launcher left@on Rabulpaila's underside?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 428,
   "en": "No, they appear to have been fired by the@high heat source that appeared... a large@mobile weapon!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 429,
   "en": "Steel Dragons... It seems I must eliminate you@to fulfill my great ambition.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 430,
   "en": "And I'll do it myself...@with this Arounzer \"Floraga\".",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 431,
   "en": "Hagane: Bridge",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 432,
   "en": "The large mobile weapon's estimated length is@120 meters! It appears to be drawing in energy@from the Cross Gate!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 433,
   "en": "So that's Herluga's trump card...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
